Blocked a FOURTH time on a new instance of the exact same bug the round explicitly guarded
against: bk-pra-3-02 quotes option b) as "F5SBDW ? PSE UR CALL AGN de 9A$SJA + PSEK" and
blames the garbling on "OCR knjige [koja] unosi grafičke greške u pozivne oznake" (the book's
