looking for it.

Sibling item P3-0012 hit the identical bug pattern (IARU/LARU) on its own third round, also
today. This looks like a systemic issue: PyMuPDF garbles callsigns/abbreviations on certain
RK pages, and workers who spot the garbling without rendering the page conclude it's a book
typo rather than an extraction artifact, then write a confident note "explaining" the fake
error. NOT refiling automatically - this is the second consecutive Recover this run, tripping
the circuit breaker, and the pattern itself needs a structural fix (a rendering step or a
brief update) before another blind repair round is likely to help.
